slug: intent-consumer-seams
what: the seams a downstream consumer needs from the intent tiers -
  a taxonomy both tiers read, language as a fit key, the ranking at
  the abstention boundary, a fitted model that persists, and slots
  described the way classes are. Spec-only: reasoning into
  specs/intent-classify.md and entries onto the board, so the lanes
  can be picked up by whoever is measuring.
touches: specs/intent-classify.md, BACKLOG.md  (NO source, NO tests)
note: intent-embedding-choice also edits this spec - expect a rebase
  there, resolve by keeping both sections.
